  "title": "True Constant — direct indicator",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "True Constant — direct indicator",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "La véritable constante booléenne de palette est directement reliée à un indicateur. Aucun opérateur d'identité ni contrôle synthétique ne remplace cette constante.\nEntrées : aucune; constante typée.\nRésultats attendus : value (bool) = true.\n\nThe Studio node stores and exposes the fixed Boolean value true through output value.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: windows-x64; LLVM 22.1.7; exact declared scalar signature.\nExpected:\noutput-value (bool) = true\n",
    "author": "",
    "automatic_versioning": false,
    "program_version": "0.0.0.0",
    "tags": ["numeric-math", "typed-values", "independent-oracle", "example"],
    "documentation_uri": ""
  },
